314
00:54:19.750 --> 00:54:30.689
Keith Kowal (Hedera Hashgraph LLC): approves a malicious PR, and then immediately does a release, cuts a release, and it's out in the wild, and that's their… that's their hack. So we want to do things that can kind of can shut that down.

