00:58:15.910 --> 00:58:34.830
Keith Kowal (Hedera Hashgraph LLC): Or you have a direct professional or open source working relationship. You know, we all, like, work with people over time, we've met them at many conferences, like, that's all strong signals. I would say medium signals is, like, you did a video call with the person. In today's AI world, it doesn't mean much, but I guess it's better than nothing.

